Two checks this tick, both refine (not repeat) tick 2's diagnosis:
(1) Commit 7cbcf76 (Tier-0 playtest cycle) is genuine flow work, same discipline as 6542621: the
ESL word-order regex extension (chat.mjs IDENTITY_PHRASES) is a real grammar generalization
(question-order AND statement-order both compile to identity-self), not a literal-string
